# FlowTree — Comentários e anexos dos cards — módulo `tasks`

@host = http://localhost:5100/api
@token = COLE_O_TOKEN_AQUI
@cardUuid = COLE_O_UUID_DO_CARD
@commentUuid = COLE_O_UUID_DO_COMENTARIO
@attachmentUuid = COLE_O_UUID_DO_ANEXO

### Listar comentários (mais recentes primeiro)
GET {{host}}/cards/{{cardUuid}}/comments
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Comentar (notifica responsável e criador do card)
POST {{host}}/cards/{{cardUuid}}/comments
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "body": "Priorizar para esta sprint."
}

### Editar comentário (só autor ou admin)
PUT {{host}}/comments/{{commentUuid}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "body": "Priorizar para esta sprint — combinado com o cliente."
}

### Excluir comentário (só autor ou admin)
DELETE {{host}}/comments/{{commentUuid}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar anexos do card
GET {{host}}/cards/{{cardUuid}}/attachments
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Enviar anexo (qualquer arquivo até 20 MB)
POST {{host}}/cards/{{cardUuid}}/attachments
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----FlowTreeBoundary

------FlowTreeBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="briefing.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./briefing.pdf
------FlowTreeBoundary--

### Excluir anexo
DELETE {{host}}/attachments/{{attachmentUuid}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
